rubric:
Identifies the configuration as belonging to a UUP (Unified Update Platform) to ISO conversion script, such as UUP dump.
] Provides accurate explanations for the settings in the [convert-UUP] section, covering updates, image cleanup, format conversions (esd/swm), and skip flags.
] Explains the application installation behaviors defined in the [Store_Apps] section, such as skipping apps, app levels, and custom lists.
] Clarifies the options for generating additional Windows editions in the [create_virtual_editions] section, including DISM usage, source deletion, and output formats.
Groups the explanations logically by the provided INI sections or maps each setting explicitly to its explanation.
Avoids inventing settings, capabilities, or behaviors not represented in the provided configuration text.
